                                                "sense_id": "afd1a264-41d6-3c6c-8cef-7a0d2141c12d",
                                                "text": "To each of these subdivisions of the phylum thus differentiated the name race may appropriately be restricted, and the sum of the peculiarities of each race may be termed race-characters. This is the phylogenetic side of anthropology, and its nomenclature should be kept clearly separate from that of the ethnological side."
